title: "INFERNUS: Classification of Emission-Line Galaxies with SDSS and WISE"
abstract: "A reproducible pipeline for classifying narrow emission-line galaxies with BPT and WHAN diagnostics, cross-matching with WISE, and estimating electron density and supermassive black hole mass."
